# Boneyard Desecrator: "{1}{B}, Sacrifice another creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. If an outlaw was sacrificed this way,
# create a Treasure token." Gas Guzzler is a Vampire Rogue, so an outlaw (CR 700.12): sacrificing it for exactly {1}{B} (Mox Jet and Mox
# Ruby, the pool left empty) gives the Desecrator its counter (a 4/5) and a Treasure. The Desecrator itself is not offered as the
# sacrifice ("another", CR 602.2b), though it is a Zombie Mercenary.

